{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103460","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910346001:1":{"text":"タラサの民よ、我が同胞たちよ。いったい何をしているんだい。","source_cn":"塔拉萨的族裔们，我的同胞们。你们究竟在做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DFCE24CA3018008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910346002:1":{"text":"家族になるかどうかに関係なく、この子たちはマザーコーラルの修復に力を貸してくれた恩人だよ。その意思は尊重されるべきだ。","source_cn":"无论这两个孩子是否选择成为我们的家人，他们都是帮助修复...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BFBE0C9E317752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910346003:1":{"text":"でも、回遊季が――","source_cn":"可是洄游季——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD4C07BB3BA6911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910346004:1":{"text":"落ち着くんだよ。お前さんは荒ぶる海流に惑わされて、冷静さを失っているんだ。","source_cn":"冷静下来，孩子。你被激荡的洋流冲昏了头脑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE520784FA1331259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910346005:1":{"text":"回遊季のために用意した養分が足りないのは、確かに心配だけれどね。それはこの子たちのせいではないし、彼らに強要する理由にはならないよ。","source_cn":"为洄游季准备的养料不足，的确令人忧心。但这不是这两个孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C6D11BDC8A2AF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910346006:1":{"text":"大丈夫。きっと解決する方法はあるよ。","source_cn":"我保证，我们会去找解决方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DC740C353D6CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910346007:1":{"text":"だからお前さんたちも、これ以上二人を困らせないでおくれ。怖い思いをしたこの子たちを、ゆっくり休ませてあげないと……","source_cn":"也希望你们能保证——现在，让开路，让这两个受惊的孩子好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24BDC2328C1FCDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910346008:1":{"text":"エフィラ、二人を家に連れていきなさい。","source_cn":"艾菲拉，带他们回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D270D93F7C62CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910346009:1":{"text":"わ、分かった……","source_cn":"……好、好的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA5C299589A6597","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910346010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、オットー、行こ！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4030898F484B0CB6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、オットー、行こ！","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、オットー、行こ！","variant_male_record_index":"255828","variant_female_reco